OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCentral Belt
OL,6,Fstaying mostly dry with clear spells.
OL,7,FCloudier across southern areas with a
OL,8,Fscattered showers for the evening,
OL,9,Fmerging into longer spells of light
OL,10,Frain overnight. Minimum Temperature 4C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FSoutheast winds keeping rather
OL,13,Fcloudy skies across the area, with
OL,14,Fshowers or longer periods of light to
OL,15,Fmoderate rain focused over the the
OL,16,Fsouth and east. Maximum Temperature 9C.
